      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Williford%2C_Arkansas"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The town’s warmest summers have been recorded in 1998, 2003, 2005, 2006, 2007, 2009, 2010, 2012, 2013, 2014, 2015, and 2016.",
